                                "sense_id": "80eab6da-3c85-32b1-b385-8a803198b5e8",
                                "text": "She wouldn't actually bring the shoes herself, but she would drive down with any complaints or remarks. I was expected to know instantly […] which pair she meant out of a sackful, and be able to suggest rubber heels, or a blakey, or whatever she would like."
